        },
        {
          "text": "Narabakunze, ni k’Uhoraho agize. Yamara muravuga, muti Wadukunze mu biki? Mbega Esau ntiyari mukuru wa Yakobo? ni k’Uhoraho abaza; ariko rero nakunze Yakobo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
