              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yow 3:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau na we naramwanse, mpindura imisozi yiwe amatongo, ishamvu yiwe ndayiha imbgebge zo mu bugaragwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naho Edomu yavuga, ati Dutsinzwe hasi, ariko tuzosubira kwubaka ahāsanganguwe; uku ni k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize, ati Bazokwubaka, ariko nanje nzosambura. Abantu bazobīta intāra y’ibigabitanyo, babīte n’ubgoko Uhoraho yama arakiye ibihe bidashira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ amaso yanyu azovyibonera, namwe muvuge, mut’ Uhoraho arahambaye no hirya y’urugabano rw’i Bgisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
